{
  "name": "unknown-target",
  "domain": "project-management",
  "format": "task-graph",
  "description": "依赖目标未登记：T1 的 dependsOn 里有两个 ID 既不在 tasks[] 也不在 idSpace[]。一个是明显的笔误（T2X），一个是被删掉的前置（T2）。两种情况在计划里长得完全一样 —— 都写着「等它」，而没有任何记录说明它是什么。这就是 P0 必须把它们枚举成候选、而不是静默丢弃的原因。",
  "input": {
    "format": "task-graph",
    "payload": {
      "planPath": "project/plan.json",
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "T1",
          "title": "订单导出",
          "owner": "alice",
          "estimateDays": 3,
          "status": "todo",
          "team": "orders",
          "dependsOn": [
            "T2",
            "T2X"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "T3",
          "title": "导出结果下载",
          "owner": "bob",
          "estimateDays": 2,
          "status": "todo",
          "team": "orders",
          "dependsOn": [
            "T1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "idSpace": [
        "EXTERNAL-RELEASE"
      ]
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 5,
    "paths": [
      "project/plan-t1-t2.json",
      "project/plan-t1-t2x.json",
      "project/plan-t3-t1.json",
      "project/plan-task-t1.json",
      "project/plan-task-t3.json"
    ],
    "admitted": 5,
    "excludedByPredicate": {
      "binary": [],
      "secret": [],
      "deleted": [],
      "user-exclude": [],
      "extension": [],
      "default-path": [],
      "too-large": []
    },
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false,
    "bundleKeys": [
      "ws/orders"
    ]
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "T3 依赖 T1 是登记完整的边，可以重算 —— 同一个图里既有能锚定的边，也有不能锚定的边，二者必须被区分。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T3",
            "to": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T3",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/plan.json"
      },
      {
        "note": "正面锚定「图里完全没出现过的目标」：NOT-REGISTERED-ANYWHERE 既没有自己的记录，也没有任何一条边引用它。它与 unregistered-target 的区别是图结构上的：unregistered-target 要求「有条边依赖它、但它没有记录」，hedged-target 要求「图里任何地方都没有它」。这条的 subject 特意给了 T1→T2 一条真实存在的边，用来证明 hedged-target 不会因为图里**有别的边**就误判成立。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "hedged-target",
            "targetId": "NOT-REGISTERED-ANYWHERE",
            "referrer": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T2"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T2"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/plan.json"
      },
      {
        "note": "正面锚定「未登记的依赖目标」：T2X 出现在 T1 的 dependsOn 里（图上有条边依赖它），而 tasks[] 与 idSpace 都没有它 —— 计划在依赖一个没人登记过的东西。这是本域最要紧的失效链接形态。它必须能正面锚定，否则这类发现只能靠叙述。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "unregistered-target",
            "targetId": "T2X",
            "referrer": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "planPath": "project/plan.json",
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1",
                    "title": "订单导出",
                    "owner": "alice",
                    "estimateDays": 3,
                    "status": "todo",
                    "team": "orders",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T2",
                      "T2X"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T3",
                    "title": "导出结果下载",
                    "owner": "bob",
                    "estimateDays": 2,
                    "status": "todo",
                    "team": "orders",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "idSpace": [
                  "EXTERNAL-RELEASE"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/plan.json"
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "「未登记依赖目标」是一个存在性声明，所以它必须能被图正面证伪：把目标 id 声明进 idSpace 之后，同一个声明就变成假的 —— 这正是把这类发现写成可重算声明（而不是一句「T2X 好像没定义」）的价值。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "unregistered-target",
            "targetId": "T2X",
            "referrer": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T2X"
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "idSpace": [
                  "T2X"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch"
      },
      {
        "note": "把 id 真的声明进 tasks[] 之后，同一个 hedged-target 声明就被图证伪 —— 这正是它可证伪的证据（而且此时它也不是 unregistered-target 的候选，因为记录存在）。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "hedged-target",
            "targetId": "T2",
            "referrer": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T2"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T2",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T9"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch"
      }
    ]
  }
}